            <title>3.9.3</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 15:38:02 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>148</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.9.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's New in 3.9.3</h2><ul></ul><p><strong>Added</strong></p><ul><li>Rename up to 1,000 files at once with PRO</li></ul><p><strong>Improved</strong></p><ul><li>Rename Rules now apply consistently to every AI-generated name</li><li>Purchase activation and automatic renaming are more reliable</li><li>AI naming recovers better from incomplete provider responses</li></ul><p><strong>Fixed</strong></p><ul><li>Fixed edge cases in checkout, monitoring, and batch renaming</li></ul>
]]></description>
